    "title": "Refillable Natural Deodorant Stick",
    "body_text": "Some deodorants mask odour. Ours neutralises it.\n\nThe Bare Necessities Refillable Natural Deodorant Stick is formulated to keep you fresh from AM to PM without aluminium, without baking soda and without synthetic antiperspirants. Just clean, plant-based odour protection that works with your body, not against it.\n\nDermatologist tested. Clinically evaluated. Double-blind study. 50 healthy adults.\n\nResults confirmed: helps neutralise underarm odour, provides up to 24-hour odour protection, leaves no visible residue, feels non-sticky, no dermatological signs of irritation observed. Not a marketing claim. An independently verified result.\n\nHow it works:\n\nMagnesium hydroxide creates an alkaline environment on skin that makes it less hospitable for odour-causing bacteria, neutralising odour at source rather than masking it. Zinc ricinoleate(derived from castor oil) traps and binds odour molecules at the molecular level. Two odour control mechanisms working simultaneously. Most natural deodorants use one. Ours uses both. Tapioca starch (derived from the cassava root) absorbs excess moisture keeping underarms dry and comfortable without blocking pores. Shea butter and squalane nourish and condition underarm skin with every application.\n\nNo pore-blocking. No synthetic antiperspirants. No irritation.\n\nThe Forever Case. The world's first refillable deodorant dispenser made from recycled plastic chips.\n\nYour refill slots into the Forever Case, a custom-manufactured dispenser crafted from recycled plastic chips, the raw material form of plastic before it's moulded into anything new. Five design patents protect the innovation. Buy it once. Refill it forever. Nothing goes to landfill.\n\nFragrance certified by the International Fragrance Association (IFRA), the global gold standard for fragrance safety. Hypoallergenic and universally wearable.\n\n30g. Made in India.",
